Multi-database Alembic configuration for Flask-Migrate.

The migration environment tracks the named SQLAlchemy binds `app_db` and
`user_db`. Each revision must provide matching `upgrade_<bind>()` and
`downgrade_<bind>()` functions. A bind that is unaffected by a revision uses
an empty function.

The unnamed SQLAlchemy default engine is intentionally excluded because it
points to the same SQLite file as `user_db`.
